{"about_the_game":"The Ancient Seal of Terrabruma has shattered, unleashing the forces of Chaos once more. As one of the last Mages of Wizordum sanctuary, you must embark on a quest to find the source of this corruption and push the Chaos back before they consume the kingdom in a speedrun-friendly fantasy FPS tearing a page from the spellbooks of \u201890s fantasy FPS classics like Hexen and Heretic.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/wizordum-steam-1.gif?t=1746564673\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A vast arsenal of magic weapons &amp; items<br></li><li> Search for secret places filled with treasures<br></li><li> Solve puzzles and avoid traps<br></li><li> Embark on a single-player campaign to find the source of Chaos, traveling from the Town of Grimbrook through swamps over the snowy mountains and beyond.<br></li><li> Collect bonus items and beat the hardest difficulty levels to climb to the top of the leaderboards<br></li><li> Beat challenges at each level<br></li><li> Compete online for the best time<br></li><li> Create and share custom levels, all from inside the game</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/wizordum-steam-2.gif?t=1746564673\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEVEL EDITOR</h2>Design and download custom adventures or full-fledged episodes with the in-game level editor.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/extras/level-editor.gif?t=1746564673\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1715590/9376b9992074a06cff7be8a65ed4bfc748c86c52.jpg"},{"name":"Clean Water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1715590/3624eddee3c5589697978d16170133263fe1158f.jpg"},{"name":"Knee Deep in the Sewers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1715590/f25633a5945aef9993abb8ef202dc89dc01ecae5.jpg"},{"name":"Dance of the Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1715590/9f149cdf533f0f73960347cbfe90557f10229922.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Entrance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1715590/90c8968882cbde150a4bfe3e131bfba1baa2b3a6.jpg"},{"name":"Ashes & Stone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1715590/3b47738eeecfcfb1869355dbc4bbe136399aa1a2.jpg"},{"name":"Culling of Grimbrook","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1715590/be99cadeddb9e500c5ed7ed2a4da426c3ec508d7.jpg"},{"name":"No Stone Left Unturned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1715590/47492f5f0bb6cec6b931eead609f5772c28a8e7e.jpg"},{"name":"Mage Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1715590/07abc59ec32bff63f12753b419129b9f03ae9d84.jpg"},{"name":"Time Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1715590/1bb66855887359390df6f4255ece6f37f2ac9ed5.jpg"}],"total":87},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1715590?t=1746564673","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1715590?t=1746564673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746564673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746564673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes le